# Byte-exact test fixtures.
#
# `stage-release` verifies the artifact's size and SHA-256 against its manifest,
# so Git must never rewrite these bytes on checkout. Git for Windows defaults to
# core.autocrlf=true, which turned the 128-byte LF artifact into 131 bytes of
# CRLF and failed every windows-latest CI run with ReleaseIntegrityError
# (exit 2) while ubuntu-latest passed.
tests/fixtures/** -text
